/* Redistricting */SCOTUS did not rule that Pennsylvania’s districts were unconstitutionally gerrymandered, PA’s Supreme Court did.  However, SCOTUS did choose not grant cert regarding the PA’s Supreme Court's decision—rendering the State Court’s decision final.   

